WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:54.214
Azalie?

00:01:55.082 --> 00:01:56.083
Don't come in!

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:01.755
Don't come in, please.

00:02:02.356 --> 00:02:03.357
Please!

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.258
Krylancelo!

00:02:21.808 --> 00:02:23.777
Azalie!

00:02:32.753 --> 00:02:33.754
Azalie...

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:44.398
the ruins of saltandenrs

00:02:52.773 --> 00:02:54.708
He's happy! He's happy!

00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:57.144
It's probably his first time at the seashore.

00:02:57.144 --> 00:02:59.546
Deep Dragons are raised in the forest, so...

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:04.584
Say, Orphen, what are we doing
in a port city anyway?

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:07.854
Crossing to an island.

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:09.122
An island?

00:03:09.523 --> 00:03:12.059
On the open sea, there are seven islands
that are no-man's land.

00:03:12.059 --> 00:03:13.894
One of those is our destination.

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:17.230
So, what in the world are you
going to do on that island?

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:22.135
There's probably a clue to
saving Azalie on that island.

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:24.771
How do you know something like that?

00:03:24.771 --> 00:03:26.440
Did you forget already?

00:03:28.108 --> 00:03:32.546
Master is on a journey to save Azalie.

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.420
You want to go to that island?

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.922
Give it up.

00:03:41.922 --> 00:03:44.758
There probably isn't anyone
stupid enough to set sail for it.

00:03:44.758 --> 00:03:46.159
What do you mean?

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:50.897
About a month ago, a monster began
appearing among the islands,

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:54.267
and a lot of us have been killed by it.

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:55.402
A monster?

00:03:55.402 --> 00:03:57.571
So, that's why everyone said no.

00:03:57.838 --> 00:04:00.040
That monster, what does it look like?

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:04.010
To say the least, it's big, and looks like
a dragon. Or so the story goes.

00:04:04.678 --> 00:04:06.613
That's... It couldn't be.

00:04:06.613 --> 00:04:08.215
Bloody August?

00:04:09.983 --> 00:04:13.887
So no matter how much you beg,
no one will take a ship out.

00:04:13.887 --> 00:04:17.958
If you really have to go,
then make your own boat.

00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:20.193
There are plenty of materials.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.063
Every one of them, dead.

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:30.270
The sea is nice, after all.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.105
Excuse me...

00:04:32.105 --> 00:04:34.508
what's so nice...

00:04:34.508 --> 00:04:38.678
about this?!

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:43.350
Well, it's doesn't look that great,

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:46.853
but it is floating, and I think it's
really good for a rush job.

00:04:46.853 --> 00:04:49.523
It's a boat, so it's only natural that it floats!

00:04:49.523 --> 00:04:50.657
Really!

00:04:50.657 --> 00:04:54.461
You'd even change your eye color
for this Azalie person!

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.730
Did you say something?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.932
Not really.

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.801
Master...

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:04.070
Isn't that...

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.338
Paddle!

00:05:05.338 --> 00:05:07.808
Can't you paddle like you're about to die?!

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:10.076
| am, Big Brother!

00:05:13.747 --> 00:05:16.016
What are those two doing?

00:05:27.093 --> 00:05:29.796
It's their business if they get eaten by a shark,

00:05:29.796 --> 00:05:33.166
but it would be a pain if the
Sword of Baltanders got eaten too.

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.467
That's true.

00:05:34.467 --> 00:05:35.802
Oh, well.

00:05:36.203 --> 00:05:38.705
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:05:51.685 --> 00:05:54.921
What do you think you're doing,
you hell-spawned sorcerer?!

00:05:56.122 --> 00:05:58.825
| saved you and you can't even say thank you?

00:05:58.825 --> 00:06:02.028
What are you guys doing in a place like this?

00:06:03.763 --> 00:06:05.065
Well, that is...

00:06:05.765 --> 00:06:11.037
Big Brother got a map to the pirate Brandy's
sunken treasure at a secondhand store and...

00:06:11.037 --> 00:06:13.640
Y-you idiot! You didn't have to tell...

00:06:14.207 --> 00:06:15.141
Map?

00:06:15.709 --> 00:06:16.877
This it?

00:06:18.278 --> 00:06:20.413
Give it back, super evil sorcerer!

00:06:20.413 --> 00:06:22.515
I'll folk-dance you to death
with the Volcan Dance!

00:06:25.418 --> 00:06:28.355
Stupid, this is a fake.

00:06:28.922 --> 00:06:31.858
Fake? Don't make things up!

00:06:31.858 --> 00:06:35.061
Look, Brandy is a Northern pirate.

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:37.731
She's never been here in the East.

00:06:37.731 --> 00:06:41.334
And in summation, there wouldn't be
any of her sunken treasure here.

00:06:41.334 --> 00:06:43.837
See? It's just as I told you.

00:06:44.104 --> 00:06:46.539
Damn, that secondhand salesman!

00:06:46.539 --> 00:06:50.443
To fool the eyes of the glorious
Volcan Polkano of Mazmaturia!

00:06:50.443 --> 00:06:53.446
I'll stay up all night and kill him by lack of sleep!

00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:55.248
Speaking of which,

00:06:56.383 --> 00:07:00.253
you guys know the phrase
“return the favor," don't you?

00:07:00.553 --> 00:07:01.554
No...

00:07:06.893 --> 00:07:08.228
Hey!

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:10.964
Don't slack off! Row, please!

00:07:11.264 --> 00:07:13.600
It always turns out like this, doesn't it?

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:15.769
Just remember this!

00:07:15.769 --> 00:07:19.973
Someday in a strength test,
I'll kill you with exercise!

00:07:32.986 --> 00:07:34.421
Can't row anymore.

00:07:40.794 --> 00:07:42.495
It's an amazing fog, isn't it?

00:07:42.495 --> 00:07:44.364
It's kind of scary, isn't it?

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:47.934
Totally feels like something's
going to jump out at us.

00:07:51.404 --> 00:07:53.406
What's wrong, Leki?

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:57.344
You know, that surprised me.

00:07:57.344 --> 00:07:59.179
Be quiet now.

00:08:04.884 --> 00:08:08.588
But Master, is this course really correct?

00:08:08.588 --> 00:08:10.490
Yeah, I'm not wrong.

00:08:11.024 --> 00:08:14.461
Could it be that you've
been there before, Master?

00:08:15.729 --> 00:08:17.230
It's an old story.

00:08:22.402 --> 00:08:24.838
Yeah, in the past.

00:08:37.017 --> 00:08:39.019
What's wrong, Krylancelo?

00:08:40.954 --> 00:08:43.423
Nothing! Nothing's wrong.

00:08:44.391 --> 00:08:46.393
Keep control of yourself.

00:08:46.393 --> 00:08:49.562
After all, this is your first job as my assistant.

00:08:49.562 --> 00:08:51.131
Yeah, leave it to me.

00:08:51.698 --> 00:08:52.899
Can I really?

00:08:52.899 --> 00:08:54.167
Yeah...

00:09:04.377 --> 00:09:05.745
What's that?

00:09:15.955 --> 00:09:17.057
This is...

00:09:17.057 --> 00:09:19.192
Who could have made this?

00:09:20.126 --> 00:09:22.829
It's a forgotten relic of the Heavenly Beings.

00:09:24.831 --> 00:09:26.132
We're here.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.269
These are the ruins of the Wheeled Dragon.

00:09:31.971 --> 00:09:33.473
Dragon...

00:09:34.474 --> 00:09:37.544
What in the world is there?

00:10:12.846 --> 00:10:17.550
Say, isn't it about time you tell us what's here?

00:10:18.051 --> 00:10:20.887
A trump card, Azalie's and mine.

00:10:21.721 --> 00:10:23.223
What's that?

00:10:23.656 --> 00:10:25.892
| don't understand at all!

00:10:28.161 --> 00:10:29.095
Wait!

00:10:38.138 --> 00:10:39.405
Wh-what?

00:10:39.405 --> 00:10:42.408
It's a ward! Someone's put up a ward!

00:10:42.408 --> 00:10:44.043
It's instead of a gate.

00:10:44.043 --> 00:10:48.114
They say these ruins are under
the protection of the Tower of Fangs.

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:52.886
Master, isn't that kind of bad?

00:10:53.153 --> 00:10:55.555
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:10:58.558 --> 00:10:59.559
Let's go.

00:11:03.429 --> 00:11:04.797
W-wait!

00:11:06.933 --> 00:11:08.134
What is this?

00:11:10.003 --> 00:11:12.105
You said it's a Heavenly Beings ruin,

00:11:12.105 --> 00:11:15.408
so I thought there'd be
humungous amounts of treasure.

00:11:15.408 --> 00:11:17.277
But it's empty!

00:11:32.625 --> 00:11:34.327
Why won't it open?

00:11:34.327 --> 00:11:35.528
It's useless.

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:39.165
The doors that won't open are
sealed by the power of the Dragon.

00:11:41.801 --> 00:11:43.570
It was the same then.

00:11:44.337 --> 00:11:46.906
What are they hiding?

00:11:51.844 --> 00:11:53.012
Leki!

00:11:54.781 --> 00:11:57.350
Leki, wait!

00:11:59.385 --> 00:12:00.820
What's this?

00:12:01.921 --> 00:12:05.158
There's no use having a ward with this here.

00:12:05.158 --> 00:12:07.527
Leki, we're going!

00:12:22.308 --> 00:12:23.743
What's that?

00:12:32.885 --> 00:12:36.222
The way they're posed looks like
they used to be holding something.

00:12:36.723 --> 00:12:38.024
You're right.

00:12:38.391 --> 00:12:41.461
Hey, there's something written here!

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.165
It looks like sorcerous writing.

00:12:46.165 --> 00:12:49.168
Then there's no way we can read this.

00:12:49.902 --> 00:12:51.237
Baltanders...

00:12:52.639 --> 00:12:56.542
Baltanders is what's written.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:00.446
It means "always something else."

00:13:01.414 --> 00:13:05.285
Then maybe, when you said
you came here before...

00:13:05.585 --> 00:13:08.755
Six years ago, at the orders of
the Tower of Fangs,

00:13:08.755 --> 00:13:10.857
for the sake of researching
and preserving the ruins,

00:13:10.857 --> 00:13:13.259
Azalie and I came here.

00:13:13.526 --> 00:13:17.530
We discovered the sword and
brought it back to the Tower of Fangs.

00:13:35.748 --> 00:13:37.817
Bal-tan...

00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:40.687
Krylancelo...

00:13:55.902 --> 00:13:59.105
Nomafrozis... brings forth from within.

00:14:00.139 --> 00:14:01.774
This is rare.

00:14:01.774 --> 00:14:04.544
It's the inheritance of the Dragon.

00:14:04.544 --> 00:14:06.412
It amplifies magic.

00:14:06.746 --> 00:14:08.848
Amplifies magic?

00:14:08.848 --> 00:14:12.585
Say, shall we just take it, this bracelet?

00:14:12.919 --> 00:14:15.755
That'd be bad. What if someone found out?

00:14:16.889 --> 00:14:19.158
Even if we take it back to
the Tower of Fangs,

00:14:19.158 --> 00:14:21.794
it'll just be used in dumb experiments.

00:14:22.328 --> 00:14:26.299
So, we should take it and be the sole users.

00:14:28.868 --> 00:14:33.106
And someday there'll come a time
when powerful magics are needed.

00:14:33.106 --> 00:14:36.976
| want to keep the bracelet for times like those.

00:14:49.789 --> 00:14:50.790
Maybe...

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:57.230
This bracelet may someday
save someone precious to you or me.

00:14:59.132 --> 00:15:02.635
This is a secret between just the two of us, okay?

00:15:03.069 --> 00:15:04.470
S-sure.

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:06.572
Hey, show me that sword too.

00:15:07.507 --> 00:15:08.708
Be careful.

00:15:09.208 --> 00:15:10.209
Of course...

00:15:11.644 --> 00:15:13.045
What a magnificent sword.

00:15:13.045 --> 00:15:15.548
Something like "The Sword of Baltanders."

00:15:16.182 --> 00:15:19.152
What kind of magic is hidden within?

00:15:19.485 --> 00:15:20.987
You can read it, Azalie?

00:15:20.987 --> 00:15:22.388
What does it mean?

00:15:23.256 --> 00:15:25.525
Even I don't know that.

00:15:26.025 --> 00:15:29.295
Well for now, let's test it to see its effects.

00:16:09.068 --> 00:16:10.470
Th-that can't be!

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.306
It changed shape!

00:16:13.306 --> 00:16:18.511
Amazing, this is the power hidden in the sword.

00:16:29.155 --> 00:16:31.324
We're going, Krylancelo.

00:16:41.434 --> 00:16:43.903
Krylancelo, what are you doing?

00:16:44.303 --> 00:16:45.304
Right.

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:49.742
Wait a minute, Azalie!

00:16:56.449 --> 00:16:58.451
What's wrong, Orphen?!

00:17:09.028 --> 00:17:10.496
It's a bracelet.

00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:13.866
Is this your trump card, Orphen?

00:17:14.133 --> 00:17:18.304
At my current power level, I can't bind Azalie.

00:17:19.272 --> 00:17:22.008
But if I use this...

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:24.911
What's that? What is it?

00:17:24.911 --> 00:17:26.145
What's that noise?
What's that? What is it?

00:17:26.145 --> 00:17:26.679
What's that? What is it?

00:17:28.214 --> 00:17:31.284
Hey! Hey! What is it?!

00:17:44.297 --> 00:17:46.098
Bloody August?!

00:17:46.098 --> 00:17:49.268
No, it looks the same,
but it's not Bloody August!

00:17:49.602 --> 00:17:52.538
Then what is this beast?!

00:17:55.107 --> 00:17:57.410
That's it! You're from then!

00:18:01.047 --> 00:18:03.749
It's coming! What are you doing, Orphen?!

00:18:03.749 --> 00:18:05.451
Hurry up and Kkill it!

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:06.953
| can't do it.

00:18:07.353 --> 00:18:09.589
It's a victim of the sword too!

00:18:09.589 --> 00:18:11.357
Wait! Where are you going?

00:18:12.224 --> 00:18:14.327
| have a plan! Come with me!

00:18:15.261 --> 00:18:16.662
Let's go, Cleao!

00:18:22.668 --> 00:18:24.337
Victim of the sword?

00:18:24.337 --> 00:18:25.738
What's that all about?

00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:29.442
It was a mouse that lived in these ruins.

00:18:29.442 --> 00:18:33.346
Don't joke around! What about that
is a mouse, you idiot sorcerer?!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.881
It's the same as Azalie.

00:18:35.881 --> 00:18:38.351
It became a beast through
the power of the sword.

00:18:38.351 --> 00:18:40.586
And then the ward at the entrance was set,

00:18:40.586 --> 00:18:42.822
and it's been trapped in here for six years.

00:18:43.122 --> 00:18:45.925
But now a section of the ruins has crumbled.

00:18:46.993 --> 00:18:49.295
Then the identity of the monster is...

00:18:49.295 --> 00:18:51.897
It's not Azalie. It's this guy!

00:18:57.203 --> 00:18:58.871
You guys hurry up and hide!

00:19:05.544 --> 00:19:06.712
Here it comes.

00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:15.454
Time to test its power now.

00:19:15.921 --> 00:19:19.191
Sleep of Atonement, that helpeth me!

00:19:26.198 --> 00:19:27.199
Amazing!

00:19:38.377 --> 00:19:41.380
This bracelet is amazingly powerful after all.

00:19:45.117 --> 00:19:46.352
Orphen!

00:19:55.628 --> 00:19:56.796
What?

00:19:56.796 --> 00:19:57.863
That is...

00:20:00.533 --> 00:20:01.667
Azalie!

00:20:07.073 --> 00:20:08.207
Azalie...

00:20:09.642 --> 00:20:13.679
You did remember this place.

00:20:21.187 --> 00:20:25.291
| don't want those jerks from
the Tower of Fangs to kill you.

00:20:25.291 --> 00:20:28.094
So, don't say anything and become bound.

00:20:28.094 --> 00:20:29.762
| can do it now.

00:20:30.229 --> 00:20:32.064
Because I have this thing!

00:20:33.199 --> 00:20:36.235
Sleep of Atonement, that helpeth me!

00:21:01.827 --> 00:21:02.762
No!

00:21:42.368 --> 00:21:43.702
Orphen...

00:21:45.204 --> 00:21:47.873
It's no good even with this?

00:21:48.207 --> 00:21:51.677
Then how am I to save you?

00:21:52.077 --> 00:21:53.179
How am I?

00:21:53.179 --> 00:21:58.884
This bracelet may someday
save someone precious to you or me.

00:21:59.351 --> 00:22:02.154
Azalie, I want you to tell me.

00:22:02.588 --> 00:22:05.391
Azalie!

00:22:09.528 --> 00:22:14.500
Next orphen

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:18.370
What if my mother or big sister
became a monster?

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:21.841
It'd be so hard, and I'd be so sad, but...

00:22:21.841 --> 00:22:23.776
| know I'd want to save them no matter what!

00:22:23.776 --> 00:22:25.611
Because I love both of them!

00:22:25.611 --> 00:22:31.917
So, tell me everything about what happened
to Orphen and Azalie six years ago.

00:22:32.251 --> 00:22:34.420
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.388
the secret of the heavenly beast: SORCERESS
"The Secret of the Heavenly Beast: Sorceress."

00:22:36.388 --> 00:22:38.991
The secret of the heavenly beast: SORCERESS
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:38.991 --> 00:22:39.491
The secret of the
heavenly beast: SORCERESS

00:22:49.935 --> 00:22:54.006
You aren't here, the one I really love

00:22:54.006 --> 00:22:58.077
My first love has reached a dead end

00:22:58.544 --> 00:23:06.785
Tonight in my dreams, a smiling you doesn't appear

00:23:07.419 --> 00:23:11.457
Your last lines came out of your lips too soon

00:23:11.457 --> 00:23:15.060
You were troubled by

00:23:15.995 --> 00:23:19.932
Your last lines as soon as your lips said them

00:23:19.932 --> 00:23:23.669
But then you kissed me

00:23:24.737 --> 00:23:29.141
To only my lips

00:23:29.141 --> 00:23:33.345
Please give your warmth

00:23:33.345 --> 00:23:37.716
To only my lips

00:23:37.716 --> 00:23:41.587
Will you always remain

00:23:41.854 --> 00:23:44.323
A gentle you

00:23:44.323 --> 00:23:48.494
To only my lips

00:23:48.494 --> 00:23:52.798
No matter how hard I try to forget

00:23:52.798 --> 00:23:57.069
To only my lips

00:23:57.069 --> 00:24:03.275
Will you always remain

00:24:03.609 --> 00:24:08.213
The last of you
